            p.why-choose__subtitle From scalable platforms to automation and AI, we build digital solutions that solve real business problems and drive measurable results.

        .why-choose__content
            .why-choose__list
                .why-choose__card
                    .why-choose__card-icon
                        svg(width="22", height="22", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="#121984", stroke-width="2")
                            rect(x="3", y="3", width="18", height="18", rx="4")
                            path(d="M7 12h10")
                            path(d="M12 7v10")
                    .why-choose__card-body
                        h3 98% Client Retention
                        p Long-term partnerships built on measurable outcomes and reliable delivery.

                .why-choose__card
                    .why-choose__card-icon
                        svg(width="22", height="22", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="#121984", stroke-width="2")
                            rect(x="3", y="3", width="18", height="18", rx="4")
                            path(d="M7 9h10")
                            path(d="M7 15h10")
                    .why-choose__card-body
                        h3 Applied AI In 8+ Industries
                        p Proven delivery across finance, healthcare, eCommerce, public sector, and more.

                .why-choose__card
                    .why-choose__card-icon
                        svg(width="22", height="22", viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="#121984", stroke-width="2")
                            circle(cx="12", cy="12", r="9")
                            path(d="M12 8v4l3 2")
                    .why-choose__card-body
                        h3 Proven Expertise
                        p Integrated teams reduce time-to-market while keeping quality and cost in check.

            .why-choose__media
                img(src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737604893-d14cc237f11d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80", alt="Hamro Idea team collaborating")
